        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>A variable-length byte array that consists of the following parameters in the specified order:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput>procedure_identifier_length</computeroutput> (1 byte)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>procedure_identifier</computeroutput> (<computeroutput>procedure_identifier_length</computeroutput> * 1 byte)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>event_info_length</computeroutput> (1 byte)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>event_info</computeroutput> (<computeroutput>event_info_length</computeroutput> * 1 byte)</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The length of <computeroutput>data</computeroutput> must be (2 + <computeroutput>procedure_identifier_length</computeroutput> + <computeroutput>event_info_length</computeroutput>) bytes. See the link layer documentation of HCI_VS_Siliconlabs_Event_Info_Report for a detailed description of the parameters. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
